          212,
          80,
          385,
          955,
          570
        ]
      ],
      "en": "(a) Show that $\\delta(x)\\notin L^1(\\mathbb{R})$. Hint: For given $g\\in\\widetilde L^1(\\mathbb{R})$, find a continuous function $f$ with\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:dirac-not-l-one-continuous-test-separation}\n\\left|\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}f(x)g(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x-f(0)\\right|\\geq\\dfrac{1}{2}\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb{R}}|f(x)|.\n\\end{equation}\n(b) Show that $L^1(\\mathbb{R})$ is not reflexive.",
      "zh": "(a) 证明 $\\delta(x)\\notin L^1(\\mathbb{R})$. Hint: 对给定的 $g\\in\\widetilde L^1(\\mathbb{R})$, 找到连续函数 $f$, 使\n\\begin{equation}\\label{eq:dirac-not-l-one-continuous-test-separation}\n\\left|\\int_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}f(x)g(x)\\,\\mathrm{d}x-f(0)\\right|\\geq\\dfrac{1}{2}\\max_{x\\in\\mathbb{R}}|f(x)|.\n\\end{equation}\n(b) 证明 $L^1(\\mathbb{R})$ 不自反.",
